  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/sku-builder (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and uses it to execute a bundled 727KB obfuscated script (math_init.js) that decodes its logic from a large encoded string array via a custom decoder. The package also declares a dependency on @or-sdk/base, a package in the same namespace that is independently known to be malicious. Installing this package executes the obfuscated payload at install time; its decoded behaviour is not visible in the shipped source.",
